iency.\n- **Prioritize Major Issues**: Focus on resolving major issues quickly to maintain backlog health.\n- **Sustainability Practices**: Ensure that the improved burn rate does not lead to team burnout by regularly assessing team capacity and workload.\n\nBy implementing these recommendations, the team can maintain efficiency and improve process management."
